erlo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Hunt","overview":"When friends on a hunting trip get into a deadly clash with other hunters, they vow to keep it a secret. But as paranoia sets in—and a ruthless gang seeks revenge—the friends must confront their morality, families, and savage instincts.","tagline":"The most dangerous enemy is the one you can't see."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Franck et ses amis passent leurs weekends à chasser ensemble. Ils se retrouvent un jour face à un groupe de chasseurs qui les prend pour cible sans raisons apparentes. L’un d’entre eux est touché. Franck et ses amis répliquent puis réussissent à s’échapper de justesse. Ils décident de garder l'incident secret, et Franck tente de reprendre une vie normale aux côtés de sa femme Krystel. Mais très vite, le groupe se sent observé, et pire, traqué par ces hommes qui semblent prêts à tout pour se venger...","tagline":"L'ennemi le plus dangereux est celui que l'on ne voit pas."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u18VyuZ2IsDGu9BcgMvvGiryF5a.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oitb5QFxxhjYzb0KK4zoooO0LSX.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2026,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u18VyuZ2IsDGu9BcgMvvGiryF5a.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/257992/season/1"}],"schema":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TVSeries","dateCreated":"2024-06-27T12:17:16Z","dateModified":"2026-04-02T02:04:33Z","description":"Durante una battuta di caccia, un gruppo di amici rimane coinvolto in uno scontro letale con altri cacciatori e decide di tacere l’accaduto. Ma quando la paranoia prende il sopravvento e una banda spietata reclama vendetta, gli amici devono fare i conti con le proprie coscienze, le proprie famiglie e i propri istinti selvaggi.","isFamilyFriendly":true,"name":"Traqués - La caccia","nu